{"guid": "N63_001", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "participant_role", "concept_label": "captain (sports)", "concept_definition": "A captain is a player chosen to lead a sports team and represent it on the field or court.", "translations": {"en": "captain", "lt": "kapitonas", "zh": "队长", "fr": "capitaine", "es": "capitán", "es-419": "capitán"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
{"guid": "N63_002", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "participant_role", "concept_label": "teammate", "concept_definition": "A teammate is a person who plays on the same sports team as another player.", "translations": {"en": "teammate", "lt": "komandos draugas", "zh": "队友", "fr": "coéquipier", "es": "compañero de equipo", "es-419": "compañero de equipo"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
{"guid": "N63_003", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "participant_role", "concept_label": "opponent (sports)", "concept_definition": "In sports, an opponent is the player or team that you compete against.", "translations": {"en": "opponent", "lt": "varžovas", "zh": "对手", "fr": "adversaire", "es": "oponente", "es-419": "rival"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
{"guid": "N63_004", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "participant_role", "concept_label": "athlete (sports)", "concept_definition": "A person who trains for or competes in sports.", "translations": {"en": "athlete", "lt": "sportininkas", "zh": "运动员", "fr": "athlète", "es": "deportista", "es-419": "deportista"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
{"guid": "N63_005", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "participant_role", "concept_label": "rookie (sports)", "concept_definition": "In sports, a rookie is a player competing in their first season at a particular level or with a particular team.", "translations": {"en": "rookie", "lt": "naujokas", "zh": "新秀", "fr": "débutant", "es": "novato", "es-419": "novato"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
{"guid": "N63_006", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "participant_role", "concept_label": "substitute (sports)", "concept_definition": "In sports, a substitute is a player who enters a game to replace another player.", "translations": {"en": "substitute", "lt": "atsarginis žaidėjas", "zh": "替补队员", "fr": "remplaçant", "es": "suplente", "es-419": "suplente"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
{"guid": "N63_007", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "participant_role", "concept_label": "forward (sports)", "concept_definition": "In many team sports, a forward is a player whose main role is to attack and try to score.", "translations": {"en": "forward", "lt": "puolėjas", "zh": "前锋", "fr": "attaquant", "es": "delantero", "es-419": "delantero"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
{"guid": "N63_008", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "participant_role", "concept_label": "defender (sports)", "concept_definition": "In sports, a defender is a player whose role is to stop the opposing team from scoring.", "translations": {"en": "defender", "lt": "gynėjas", "zh": "防守队员", "fr": "défenseur", "es": "defensor", "es-419": "defensor"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
{"guid": "N63_009", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "participant_role", "concept_label": "goalkeeper (sports)", "concept_definition": "In sports, a goalkeeper is a player whose main job is to protect their team's goal and stop opponents from scoring.", "translations": {"en": "goalkeeper", "lt": "vartininkas", "zh": "守门员", "fr": "gardien de but", "es": "portero", "es-419": "arquero"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
{"guid": "N63_010", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "participant_role", "concept_label": "goalie (sports)", "concept_definition": "In sports, a goalie is a player whose main job is to prevent the opposing team from scoring by defending the goal.", "translations": {"en": "goalie", "lt": "vartininkas", "zh": "守门员", "fr": "gardien de but", "es": "portero", "es-419": "portero"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
{"guid": "N63_011", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "participant_role", "concept_label": "winger (sports)", "concept_definition": "In sports such as soccer, a winger is an attacking player who plays mainly on one side of the field.", "translations": {"en": "winger", "lt": "krašto puolėjas", "zh": "边锋", "fr": "ailier", "es": "extremo", "es-419": "extremo"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
{"guid": "N63_012", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "participant_role", "concept_label": "champion (sports)", "concept_definition": "In sports, a champion is the person or team that wins a competition or holds its title.", "translations": {"en": "champion", "lt": "čempionas", "zh": "冠军", "fr": "champion", "es": "campeón", "es-419": "campeón"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
{"guid": "N63_013", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "participant_role", "concept_label": "seed (sports)", "concept_definition": "In a sports competition, a seed is a player or team ranked before play begins so that the strongest competitors are less likely to meet until later rounds.", "translations": {"en": "seed", "lt": "pajėgumo reitingas", "zh": "种子选手", "fr": "tête de série", "es": "cabeza de serie", "es-419": "cabeza de serie"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
{"guid": "N63_014", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "participant_role", "concept_label": "wild card (sports)", "concept_definition": "In sports, a wild card is a place in a competition awarded to a player or team that did not qualify through the usual qualifying process.", "translations": {"en": "wild card", "lt": "vardinis kvietimas", "zh": "外卡", "fr": "invitation spéciale", "es": "invitación especial", "es-419": "invitación especial"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
{"guid": "N63_015", "pos_type": "noun", "pos_subtype": "participant_role", "concept_label": "server (sports)", "concept_definition": "In sports, a server is the player whose turn it is to put the ball or other object into play by serving.", "translations": {"en": "server", "lt": "paduodantysis", "zh": "发球员", "fr": "serveur", "es": "sacador", "es-419": "sacador"}, "difficulty_level": 405, "disambiguation": {"en": "sports"}, "sense_prominence": "rare"}
